# ChicanoDev — short channel/site introduction
# Render: vhs tapes/00-chicanodev-intro.tape
Output recordings/00-chicanodev-intro.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 65ms

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "echo 'ChicanoDev'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Engineering knowledge belongs to everyone.'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Linux  |  DevOps  |  Programming  |  AI automation'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Built on experience. Shared with everyone.'"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "echo 'https://chicanodev.com'"
Enter
Sleep 3s
